What about the hundreds of thousands of people, Jews, pagans, that they kill, they enslave, they torture? What about the whole notion of imperialism? What about the whole notion of might is right? What about the notion of uprooting people from the land? They don't tell you that this is wrong. What do they tell you about Greeks?

01:11:50.025 --> 01:12:11.254
About the beauty of greed. What about sodomy, masochism, bestiality practice among them? What about the infanticide, killing children? What about killing girls? What about considering humans as chattel?

01:12:11.254 --> 01:12:32.439
What about the right of parents in Greece to take the children and beat them to death in the in the temples when the children disobey? They don't tell you this, all right? So it is time for us Jews to become not only geographically emancipated.

01:12:32.439 --> 01:13:00.930
Mentally, spiritually emancipated—that is important. We could not have done it maybe fifty years ago. Now we have Israel. There is no reason for us to say Columbus is a god. Columbus is a god. Look what he writes. All right. I want to show you something about Columbus. Yes, a a an enigma. You know how he signed his his letters to his children.

