For the 1922, still there were Jews in there. He has part of his money has to be given to enter to the kudaiya, enter to the Jewish quarters, and just to be given to a rabbi. Money to be given to a rabbi. He gives this to his son. This is the Masila. It's written. It's written. It's written. It is written. I want to show it to you. It is written. But the most important thing, which is this.

