01:25:31.979 --> 01:25:56.618
Either you use it or lose it. If you don't use it, you will lose it. You raise your hand. I want to answer your question. Yeah. One thing: whenever royalty, any person was king or somebody wanted to have the country civilized, it was working Jews. Of course, all over Europe, all over Asia, the past.

01:25:56.618 --> 01:26:23.924
So I taxed and we merchants and all that. But then once when the people rose up against against taxes, all right, let's kick them out. We burned. With all due respect to South America, I was born in South America, and I do respect and love that country. What is the difference between Mexico and in America? Did I tell you what the difference is? In America, we had Jews.

01:26:23.924 --> 01:26:33.385
Officially living as Jews, imagine it happens. That might be. I just find you very scary.

01:26:33.385 --> 01:26:59.979
Because you say he came to discover America, and the Zippurs came 500 years later. Does America welcome all the Jews that were destroyed in Europe? All the Yishuv started. All the money came, and now the money goes to Israel. They have never before. You have to recognize. So the Zippurs came. They came 500 years later. I'm not saying that the No Zippurs came, but the Zippurs took to take 500 years, and it still is not recognized.

01:26:59.979 --> 01:27:11.703
